WEBVTT

00:00:00.156 --> 00:00:03.068
MiCaja also <b>checks out from your phone</b>

00:00:03.137 --> 00:00:11.540
Search and tap: the product is added without leaving the list

00:00:11.736 --> 00:00:15.767
At the bottom you always see your running total

00:00:15.826 --> 00:00:18.657
Tap it and the cart opens to check out

00:00:18.721 --> 00:00:24.502
Type how much they pay you, and check out

00:00:24.642 --> 00:00:31.234
The menu has the cash tools: collect credit, expenses and the cash count
